//     c. If awaited.[[Type]] is throw, return Completion(awaited).
//     d. Assert: awaited.[[Type]] is normal.
//     e. Return Completion { [[Type]]: return, [[Value]]: awaited.[[Value]],
//        [[Target]]: empty }.
